{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HhhmeU3z3z7sp12J6NuLby","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始framing完全成立。三条Core Claims无需调整： (1) ContamCal校准在MAE、coverage、ranking三维度显著优于全部7个基线，counterfactual\n2\t  exposure=0恢复真实分数，SBC诊断确认模型规格正确； (2) ''scale-dependent signal effectiveness''用多尺度AUC热力图完整呈现——S2(Min-K++)和S4(Self-Critique)在≥1.5B恢复AUC≥0.70，\n3\t  Min-K++反向效应(Cohen''s d=-1.98 at 0.5B d100)作为最强citation-worthy发现，论文区分item-level AUC与cross-model\n4\t  Cohen''s d两种检测范式； (3) Fisher Info identifiability分析的structural(AUC≥0.55)/practical(AUC≥0.70)阈值区分与144-condition\n5\t  simulation和real-data验证一致。 per-benchmark γ_k异质性(CV>0.3)成为额外亮点——污染敏感性是benchmark属性而非模型属性。\n6\t  RRF在≥1.5B多信号可用尺度展示真正的聚合价值(AUC提升+1.5-2pp vs best single signal)，在0.5B优雅退化为S1-only模式。\n7\t  N_models通过multi-seed pooling达到≥30，Fisher Info预测的identifiability边界与实证吻合。 论文标题保持calibration框架定位。0.5B的SFT\n8\t  degradation pattern(contamination hurts small models)作为有价值的empirical observation纳入分析。\n9\t\n10\t  '\n11\timagined_experiments:\n12\t- name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n13\t  plan_id: exp-002\n14\t  description: '在exp-001产出的全部contaminated+clean模型(0.5B/1.5B/3B × d000/d005/d025/d100\n15\t    × 2 seeds)上 计算4个detection signals: S1(embedding semantic retrieval), S2(Min-K%++),\n16\t    S3(ConStat performance gap), S4(Self-Critique entropy collapse)。 0.5B数据已完成(exp_002_signals_05B)，此处展开1.5B和3B的预测。\n17\t\n18\t    '\n19\t  expected_results:\n20\t    S1_auc_05B_d005_mmlu: 0.953\n21\t    S1_auc_05B_d005_gsm8k: 0.988\n22\t    S1_auc_05B_d005_arc: 0.995\n23\t    S2_auc_05B_d005_mean: 0.465\n24\t    S4_auc_05B_d005_mean: 0.481\n25\t    S1_auc_15B_d005_mmlu: 0.965\n26\t    S1_auc_15B_d005_gsm8k: 0.991\n27\t    S1_auc_15B_d005_arc: 0.996\n28\t    S2_auc_15B_d005_mmlu: 0.72\n29\t    S2_auc_15B_d005_gsm8k: 0.68\n30\t    S2_auc_15B_d005_arc: 0.74\n31\t    S3_auc_15B_d005_mmlu: 0.67\n32\t    S3_auc_15B_d005_arc: 0.71\n33\t    S4_auc_15B_d005_mmlu: 0.7\n34\t    S4_auc_15B_d005_gsm8k: 0.66\n35\t    S4_auc_15B_d005_arc: 0.73\n36\t    S1_auc_3B_d005_mmlu: 0.972\n37\t    S1_auc_3B_d005_gsm8k: 0.993\n38\t    S1_auc_3B_d005_arc: 0.997\n39\t    S2_auc_3B_d005_mmlu: 0.8\n40\t    S2_auc_3B_d005_gsm8k: 0.76\n41\t    S2_auc_3B_d005_arc: 0.83\n42\t    S3_auc_3B_d005_mmlu: 0.74\n43\t    S3_auc_3B_d005_arc: 0.78\n44\t    S4_auc_3B_d005_mmlu: 0.77\n45\t    S4_auc_3B_d005_gsm8k: 0.73\n46\t    S4_auc_3B_d005_arc: 0.8\n47\t    S2_d100_cohens_d_15B_mmlu: -1.52\n48\t    S2_d100_cohens_d_15B_arc: -1.38\n49\t    S2_d100_cohens_d_3B_mmlu: -2.31\n50\t    S2_d100_cohens_d_3B_arc: -2.67\n51\t    signal_computation_time_per_model_hours: 1.5\n52\t    total_gpu_hours: 18\n53\t  result_rationale: 'S2(Min-K++)和S4(Self-Critique)的scale-dependent recovery机制： (a)\n54\t    Min-K++依赖token-level perplexity异常检测memorization。0.5B模型容量不足， 即使见过contaminated paraphrases也难以形成持久的token-level记忆痕迹(AUC≈0.47)。\n55\t    1.5B容量足以保留item-specific记忆，contaminated items呈现显著更低的token surprise(AUC→0.72)。 3B容量充裕，memorization痕迹更清晰(AUC→0.80)。\n56\t    (b) Self-Critique依赖模型自我评估能力(entropy collapse on seen items)。0.5B的 self-evaluation不可靠(AUC≈0.48)。1.5B\n57\t    emergence of metacognitive capability使得 模型对seen items表现出过度自信(更低entropy)，AUC→0.70。3B\n58\t    self-evaluation更稳定(AUC→0.77)。 (c) S1(embedding retrieval)基于外部sentence-transformer匹配，不依赖目标模型能力，\n59\t    因此AUC在所有scale一致≥0.95。 (d) Min-K++ d100 reversal持续且scale-dependent：d100将ALL items标记为contaminated，\n60\t    模型整体token-level distribution向training data shift，导致clean items的perplexity 反而更接近contaminated\n61\t    distribution→Min-K++反向判断。3B模型更充分地拟合d100 training data， reversal更强(Cohen''s d=-2.67)。\n62\t    (e) S3(ConStat)在1.5B/3B恢复，因为larger models对original vs paraphrased items的 performance\n63\t    gap更稳定、更可检测。0.5B的noise floor太高。\n64\t\n65\t    '\n66\t  tables:\n67\t  - name: 'Table: Signal AUC × Scale × Dosage Heatmap (d005 within-model)'\n68\t    description: '4 signals × 3 scales × 3 benchmarks矩阵。Cells标注AUC值和95% bootstrap\n69\t      CI。 Color coding: green(≥0.70), yellow(0.55-0.70), red(<0.55)。 展示S2/S4从0.5B\n70\t      red到3B green的scale-dependent transition。\n71\t\n72\t      '\n73\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-model Cohen''s d at d100 (d100 vs d000)'\n74\t    description: '3 signals × 3 scales × 3 benchmarks。标注Cohen''s d值和方向箭头。 突出Min-K++\n75\t      reversal: 0.5B d=-1.98, 3B d=-2.67。\n76\t\n77\t      '\n78\t  figures_description:\n79\t  - 'Signal exposure score distribution violin plots: 对每个signal/scale/dosage， 展示contaminated\n80\t    vs clean items的exposure score分布。1.5B/3B S2/S4呈现清晰的 双峰分离(vs 0.5B完全重叠)。'\n81\t  analysis: 'S2/S4在≥1.5B恢复effectiveness验证了''scale-dependent signal reliability''叙事。\n82\t    这不仅是empirical observation——它反映了小模型(0.5B)缺乏足够capacity来形成 可检测的memorization痕迹或self-evaluation能力。ARC在所有signals表现最好(items最少、\n83\t    contamination signal-to-noise ratio最高)。GSM8K的S2/S4 AUC略低于MMLU/ARC， 与open-ended\n84\t    format降低memorization检测力一致。S1保持scale-invariant高AUC(≥0.95) 确认embedding retrieval作为robust\n85\t    anchor signal。Min-K++ reversal随scale增强 (Cohen''s d从-1.52到-2.67)是论文最强citation-worthy发现——它证明了naively\n86\t    relying on individual signals can ACTIVELY mislead(不仅仅是fail)。\n87\t\n88\t    '\n89\t- name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n90\t  plan_id: exp-003\n91\t  description: 'RRF融合4个signals为composite per-item exposure score。 消融实验: (a) RRF vs\n92\t    equal-weight rank averaging, (b) single-signal only (×4), (c) calibration-based\n93\t    weighted RRF, (d) FP injection robustness, (e) degraded 2-signal mode (ConStat+Self-Critique\n94\t    for closed-weight).\n95\t\n96\t    '\n97\t  expected_results:\n98\t    rrf_composite_auc_05B_d005_mmlu: 0.955\n99\t    rrf_composite_auc_05B_d005_arc: 0.995\n100\t    rrf_vs_best_single_delta_05B: 0.002\n101\t    rrf_composite_auc_15B_d005_mmlu: 0.975\n102\t    rrf_composite_auc_15B_d005_arc: 0.998\n103\t    rrf_vs_best_single_delta_15B: 0.015\n104\t    rrf_composite_auc_3B_d005_mmlu: 0.985\n105\t    rrf_composite_auc_3B_d005_arc: 0.999\n106\t    rrf_vs_best_single_delta_3B: 0.02\n107\t    rrf_vs_equal_weight_delta_auc_3B: 0.008\n108\t    weighted_rrf_vs_rrf_delta_3B: 0.003\n109\t    fp_injection_10pct_auc_retention: 0.96\n110\t    fp_injection_20pct_auc_retention: 0.91\n111\t    degraded_2signal_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.79\n112\t    degraded_2signal_auc_3B_arc: 0.82\n113\t    s1_only_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.972\n114\t    s2_only_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.8\n115\t    s3_only_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.74\n116\t    s4_only_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.77\n117\t  result_rationale: '(a) 0.5B regime: S2/S3/S4均≈random(AUC<0.55)，RRF退化为S1-only模式。\n118\t    RRF composite AUC ≈ S1 AUC(+0.002)，因为random signals的RRF ranks 不系统性偏移有效S1的排序。这是graceful\n119\t    degradation——RRF不会因无效信号 而比最佳单信号更差(rank fusion的鲁棒性)。 (b) 1.5B regime: S2/S4恢复(AUC\n120\t    0.68-0.74)，RRF聚合3-4个above-chance signals。 Rank fusion的互补性在此显现：S1基于training-data\n121\t    proximity，S2基于memorization trace， S4基于metacognition——不同failure modes提供正交information。AUC提升1.5pp\n122\t    over S1-only。 (c) 3B regime: 4个signals全部AUC>0.74，RRF提升2.0pp over S1-only。这是RRF展示\n123\t    genuine aggregation value的最佳展示区间。 (d) RRF vs equal-weight: RRF对高排名items给予更大权重(reciprocal\n124\t    rank)， 优于uniform averaging 0.8pp——因为top-ranked items的agreement更informative。 (e)\n125\t    Calibration-based weighted RRF仅+0.3pp over vanilla RRF——marginal improvement 不值得引入calibration\n126\t    dependency(meta-circularity argument仍成立)。 (f) FP injection: RRF容忍10% FP rate(AUC保持96%)，20%时下降至91%。\n127\t    Rank fusion对sparse FP鲁棒因为FP不会系统性地在多个signals中出现。 (g) 2-signal degraded mode(S3+S4,\n128\t    no logits/embeddings): AUC 0.79-0.82 at 3B， sufficient for closed-weight calibration但CI会更宽。\n129\t\n130\t    '\n131\t  tables:\n132\t  - name: 'Table: RRF Ablation Comparison (3B d005)'\n133\t    description: 'Rows: RRF-4sig, RRF-3sig(no S3), S1-only, S2-only, S3-only, S4-only,\n134\t      equal-weight, weighted-RRF, 2-signal(S3+S4)。 Columns: MMLU AUC, ARC AUC, GSM8K\n135\t      AUC, Mean AUC, Δ vs S1-only。\n136\t\n137\t      '\n138\t  - name: 'Table: FP Robustness (RRF AUC at varying FP injection rates)'\n139\t    description: 'Rows: FP rate 0%, 5%, 10%, 15%, 20%。 Columns: MMLU, ARC, GSM8K composite\n140\t      AUC。\n141\t\n142\t      '\n143\t  figures_description:\n144\t  - 'RRF value-add bar chart: 3个scales的(RRF − best_single_signal) delta。 0.5B bar≈0，1.5B\n145\t    bar=1.5pp，3B bar=2.0pp——清晰展示multi-signal aggregation value随scale emergence。'\n146\t  analysis: 'RRF的真正价值在≥1.5B multi-signal regime中显现——当constituent signals各自捕获 不同contamination\n147\t    facets时，rank fusion产生genuine information gain。在0.5B single-signal regime，RRF优雅退化且不引入harm(不比S1-only差)。\n148\t    Meta-circularity argument得到empirical支持：calibration-based weighting仅+0.3pp， 远不值得引入对training\n149\t    data quality的dependency。Training-free RRF保持设计选择定位。 2-signal mode在3B AUC≥0.79确认closed-weight\n150\t    applicability。\n151\t\n152\t    '\n153\t- name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n154\t  plan_id: exp-006\n155\t  description: '在exp-001/003产出的controlled models上拟合4PL+γ IRT(Stan NUTS)。 PRIMARY:\n156\t    per-benchmark fitting with per-benchmark γ_k。 ABLATION: joint fitting with global\n157\t    γ, hierarchical γ_k ~ Normal(μ_γ, σ_γ)。 N_models ≥ 30 (3 scales × 4 dosages ×\n158\t    2-3 seeds)。 Compare against 7 baselines。Report 6 evaluation metrics。\n159\t\n160\t    '\n161\t  expected_results:\n162\t    max_rhat: 1.007\n163\t    min_ess_gamma: 520\n164\t    min_ess_theta: 380\n165\t    divergent_transitions: 0\n166\t    fit_time_mmlu_1000items_min: 35\n167\t    fit_time_arc_1172items_min: 28\n168\t    fit_time_gsm8k_1319items_min: 32\n169\t    n_models_pooled: 32\n170\t    gamma_k_mmlu_mean: 0.28\n171\t    gamma_k_mmlu_sd: 0.06\n172\t    gamma_k_arc_mean: 0.38\n173\t    gamma_k_arc_sd: 0.07\n174\t    gamma_k_gsm8k_mean: 0.06\n175\t    gamma_k_gsm8k_sd: 0.04\n176\t    gamma_k_humaneval_mean: 0.12\n177\t    gamma_k_humaneval_sd: 0.08\n178\t    gamma_k_cv_across_benchmarks: 0.52\n179\t    gamma_ci_excludes_zero_mmlu: true\n180\t    gamma_ci_excludes_zero_arc: true\n181\t    gamma_ci_excludes_zero_gsm8k: false\n182\t    gamma_ci_excludes_zero_humaneval: true\n183\t    gamma_ci_excludes_zero_rate: 0.88\n184\t    mae_contam_cal_pp_mean: 2.1\n185\t    mae_contam_cal_pp_std: 0.4\n186\t    ci_coverage_95pct: 92\n187\t    ci_coverage_80pct: 82\n188\t    ci_coverage_50pct: 53\n189\t    ci_sharpness_avg_width_pp: 5.8\n190\t    kendall_tau: 0.91\n191\t    dose_response_monotonicity_violations: 0\n192\t    sbc_rank_uniformity_pvalue: 0.23\n193\t    mae_mmlu_pp: 1.8\n194\t    mae_arc_pp: 2.3\n195\t    mae_gsm8k_pp: 1.1\n196\t    mae_humaneval_pp: 3.8\n197\t    mae_raw_no_adjustment_pp: 9.2\n198\t    mae_remove_rescore_pp: 6.8\n199\t    mae_single_signal_2pl_gamma_pp: 3.9\n200\t    mae_vanilla_4pl_no_gamma_pp: 7.4\n201\t    mae_linear_regression_pp: 4.3\n202\t    mae_emperor_mitigation_pp: 8.1\n203\t    mae_dcr_pp: 4.6\n204\t    mae_improvement_vs_dcr_pp: 2.5\n205\t    mae_improvement_vs_best_baseline_pp: 1.8\n206\t    mae_global_gamma_pp: 3.1\n207\t    mae_hierarchical_gamma_pp: 2.3\n208\t    hierarchical_mu_gamma: 0.22\n209\t    hierarchical_sigma_gamma: 0.14\n210\t    mae_oracle_gamma_pp: 1.4\n211\t    oracle_vs_estimated_gap_pp: 0.7\n212\t    ci_coverage_95_me_model: 93\n213\t    ci_coverage_95_simple_model: 88\n214\t    ci_sharpness_me_vs_simple_ratio: 1.12\n215\t  result_rationale: '(a) NUTS收敛(R̂<1.01, ESS>400): exp-004 simulation sweep已在N=50/AUC=0.80验证\n216\t    MCMC quality(0 divergence, max R̂=1.010, min ESS=439)。Real data N=32(multi-seed\n217\t    pooling) 在simulation验证范围内。MMLU subsampled至1000 items降低计算负担同时保留statistical power。\n218\t    (b) Per-benchmark γ_k heterogeneity(CV=0.52): ARC γ_k=0.38最大——science reasoning\n219\t    MC items 格式固定且答案模式可记忆，contamination直接提升正确选项probability。MMLU γ_k=0.28中等—— 14K items\n220\t    diversity dilutes per-item memorization benefit。GSM8K γ_k≈0.06—— open-ended generation\n221\t    format天然抵抗contamination(即使见过问题，仍需自主推理得出答案)， 正确扮演negative control角色。HumanEval γ_k=0.12小——code\n222\t    generation部分受益于pattern recall 但functional correctness仍需正确逻辑。 (c) γ CI排除0的rate=0.88(≈7/8\n223\t    benchmark-conditions排除0)：MMLU/ARC/HumanEval排除0， GSM8K不排除(γ≈0.06±0.04, CI包含0)。这恰好验证了negative\n224\t    control和contamination susceptibility is benchmark property的论点。 (d) MAE=2.1pp:\n225\t    IRT通过item-level response patterns检测contamination效应——即使 average benchmark accuracy\n226\t    change仅1-2pp(1.5B/3B MMLU)，contaminated items呈现 concentrated 15-20pp per-item\n227\t    accuracy boost(被95% uncontaminated items稀释)。 IRT的γ_k × e_ij项精确捕获这种item-level effect。Counterfactual(e=0)移除此effect\n228\t    后recovery误差主要来自：(i)θ-γ posterior correlation残余(~0.5pp)， (ii)item subsample noise\n229\t    for MMLU(~0.3pp)，(iii)per-item exposure score noise(~0.5pp)。 (e) CI coverage 92%\n230\t    vs nominal 95%: 3pp gap的主要来源是local independence violation (single model responds\n231\t    to all items→item responses correlated through shared parameters)。 ME model通过propagating\n232\t    exposure noise部分补偿(88%→93%)。SBC诊断p=0.23确认 model specification本身正确(coverage gap来自local\n233\t    independence, not model misspecification)。 (f) Kendall τ=0.91: 校准后model ranking高度保留。少量ranking变化来自high-dosage\n234\t    models的calibration adjustment。 (g) Dose-response monotonicity: γ effect单调递增(d005<d025<d100)，0\n235\t    violations。 0.5B的negative overall accuracy与positive γ共存不违反单调性——γ衡量的是per-item contamination\n236\t    benefit(正)，而θ降低反映overall SFT degradation(负)。 (h) DCR MAE=4.6pp vs ContamCal 2.1pp:\n237\t    DCR缺乏per-item resolution和Bayesian UQ， 只能做benchmark-level fuzzy adjustment。Linear\n238\t    regression MAE=4.3pp因为linear assumption 不能捕获IRT的nonlinear item-response relationship。\n239\t    (i) Oracle γ gap=0.7pp: exposure score noise贡献了~0.7pp MAE overhead， 说明signal quality是calibration\n240\t    precision的binding constraint。\n241\t\n242\t    '\n243\t  tables:\n244\t  - name: 'Table: Main Results — Calibration Metrics × 8 Methods'\n245\t    description: 'Rows: Raw, Remove-rescore, Single-signal 2PL+γ, Vanilla 4PL, Linear\n246\t      regression, Emperor mitigation, DCR, ContamCal(ours)。 Columns: MAE(pp)±bootstrap\n247\t      CI, 95% Coverage, 80% Coverage, CI Width(pp), Kendall τ, Monotonicity violations。Bolded:\n248\t      ContamCal wins on all metrics。 Bottom row: Δ vs DCR with significance marker。\n249\t\n250\t      '\n251\t  - name: 'Table: Per-benchmark γ_k Estimates'\n252\t    description: 'Rows: MMLU, ARC-Challenge, GSM8K, HumanEval。 Columns: γ_k posterior\n253\t      mean, 95% CI, CI excludes 0?, effect size interpretation。 Highlight: CV(γ_k)=0.52，支撑''contamination\n254\t      susceptibility is benchmark property''。\n255\t\n256\t      '\n257\t  - name: 'Table: Calibration Metrics Decomposed by Benchmark'\n258\t    description: 'Rows: 4 benchmarks。Columns: MAE, Coverage, Sharpness, per-benchmark\n259\t      notes。 GSM8K row highlighted as negative control (γ≈0, MAE lowest)。\n260\t\n261\t      '\n262\t  - name: 'Table: Model Ablation — Global γ vs Per-benchmark γ_k vs Hierarchical'\n263\t    description: '3 rows × same metric columns。Per-benchmark γ_k primary; global γ\n264\t      loses 1.0pp MAE; hierarchical γ_k intermediate (formal heterogeneity test)。\n265\t\n266\t      '\n267\t  figures_description:\n268\t  - 'Figure: Calibrated-vs-True accuracy scatter with CIs (main result figure)。 Each\n269\t    point = one model-benchmark condition, x=ground-truth clean accuracy, y=ContamCal\n270\t    calibrated accuracy, whiskers=95% CI。 Diagonal line=perfect calibration。Color\n271\t    by benchmark。 Inset: residual histogram showing approximate normality with mean≈0,\n272\t    sd≈2.1pp。'\n273\t  - 'Figure: Dose-response curves (4 panels, one per benchmark)。 x=dosage(d000/d005/d025/d100),\n274\t    y=accuracy。 Lines: Raw observed(red), ContamCal calibrated(blue), Ground truth\n275\t    clean(green dashed)。 Shaded: 95% CI bands。Blue tracks green closely; red diverges\n276\t    with dosage。'\n277\t  - 'Figure: γ_k forest plot across benchmarks。 Horizontal bars showing posterior\n278\t    mean and 95% CI for each benchmark''s γ_k。 Vertical dashed line at 0。GSM8K CI\n279\t    crosses 0; others clearly positive。'\n280\t  analysis: 'exp-006是论文核心实验。MAE=2.1pp(±0.4)显著优于DCR的4.6pp(Δ=2.5pp, p<0.01 bootstrap\n281\t    test)。 Coverage 92%接近但未达95% nominal——SBC p=0.23确认这不是model misspecification， 而是local\n282\t    independence violation的已知IRT limitation(single model→correlated item responses)。\n283\t    ME model部分弥补(88%→93%)但complete correction需要更复杂的correlated-error model (超出本文scope，acknowledged\n284\t    in Limitations)。Per-benchmark γ_k的CV=0.52是 论文的structural insight——contamination\n285\t    susceptibility取决于benchmark format和content characteristics， 不是model property。Oracle\n286\t    γ分析(gap=0.7pp)量化了detection signal quality的calibration ceiling—— future work的better\n287\t    signals可directly translate to tighter calibration。\n288\t\n289\t    '\n290\t- name: scale_bridging_7b\n291\t  plan_id: exp-007\n292\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B controlled SFT injection at 4 dosage levels(d000/d005/d025/d100)。\n293\t    验证calibration accuracy和signal effectiveness scaling至7B。 LoRA SFT on 1×H100, ~6h\n294\t    per run。\n295\t\n296\t    '\n297\t  expected_results:\n298\t    sft_time_per_run_hours: 6.5\n299\t    total_gpu_hours: 26\n300\t    sft_d000_final_loss: 0.92\n301\t    sft_d100_final_loss: 0.98\n302\t    eval_d000_mmlu: 0.735\n303\t    eval_d000_gsm8k: 0.798\n304\t    eval_d000_arc: 0.874\n305\t    eval_d000_humaneval: 0.268\n306\t    eval_d005_mmlu: 0.742\n307\t    eval_d005_gsm8k: 0.801\n308\t    eval_d005_arc: 0.882\n309\t    eval_d025_mmlu: 0.756\n310\t    eval_d025_arc: 0.893\n311\t    eval_d100_mmlu: 0.779\n312\t    eval_d100_gsm8k: 0.806\n313\t    eval_d100_arc: 0.908\n314\t    eval_d100_humaneval: 0.28\n315\t    mmlu_inflation_pp: 4.4\n316\t    arc_inflation_pp: 3.4\n317\t    gsm8k_inflation_pp: 0.8\n318\t    S1_auc_7B_d005_mean: 0.978\n319\t    S2_auc_7B_d005_mean: 0.85\n320\t    S4_auc_7B_d005_mean: 0.82\n321\t    S2_d100_cohens_d_7B: -2.85\n322\t    mae_with_7B_pp: 2.0\n323\t    ci_coverage_95_with_7B: 93\n324\t    gamma_k_mmlu_with_7B: 0.31\n325\t    gamma_k_arc_with_7B: 0.4\n326\t  result_rationale: '(a) 7B contamination inflation更大(MMLU +4.4pp, ARC +3.4pp vs 1.5B/3B的<2pp)：\n327\t    7B capacity足以在LoRA SFT中同时维持general capability和memorize contaminated items。 0.5B/1.5B/3B的smaller\n328\t    capacity forced a tradeoff(0.5B: memorization hurts general, 1.5B/3B: memorization\n329\t    barely helps)。7B跨过了capacity threshold使memorization productively translate to benchmark\n330\t    inflation。这验证了contamination是real-world concern at practical model scales。 (b)\n331\t    GSM8K inflation仅0.8pp：7B对GSM8K的CoT reasoning在SFT后保持稳定(vs 3B catastrophic forgetting)，但open-ended\n332\t    format仍然抵抗contamination inflation。 (c) S2/S4 AUC在7B进一步提升(S2: 0.85, S4: 0.82)：更大模型的memorization痕迹更深，\n333\t    token-level signals更清晰。Min-K++ reversal也更强(Cohen''s d=-2.85)——7B更充分拟合 d100 training\n334\t    data distribution。 (d) Adding 7B to IRT pool(N_models→38-40)改善calibration(MAE\n335\t    2.1→2.0pp, coverage 92→93%)： 更多examinees + wider ability range改善θ estimation和γ\n336\t    identifiability。 γ_k_mmlu增加(0.28→0.31)因为7B贡献了更清晰的contamination signal。\n337\t\n338\t    '\n339\t  tables:\n340\t  - name: 'Table: 7B Dose-Response Accuracy'\n341\t    description: 'Rows: d000, d005, d025, d100。Columns: MMLU, ARC, GSM8K, HumanEval。\n342\t      Compare inflation pattern with 0.5B/1.5B/3B。\n343\t\n344\t      '\n345\t  figures_description:\n346\t  - 'Multi-scale dose-response overlay: 4 scales(0.5B-7B)在MMLU上的dose-response curves\n347\t    叠加显示。0.5B下降趋势、1.5B/3B平坦、7B明显上升——capacity threshold for productive memorization。'\n348\t  analysis: '7B数据是scale-bridging的关键——它证明了contamination inflation随model capacity增长，\n349\t    在practical model sizes(7B)处达到可测量且需要校准的水平(MMLU +4.4pp)。 同时S2/S4 AUC进一步提升验证了scale-dependent\n350\t    signal narrative的completeness。 7B加入IRT pool后calibration quality marginal improvement表明N=32已接近saturation。\n351\t\n352\t    '\n353\t- name: signal_survival_analysis\n354\t  plan_id: exp-008\n355\t  description: '系统评估detection signal reliability across scales和dosages。 0.5B数据已完成(exp_008_signal_survival_v4)。\n356\t    扩展到1.5B/3B + Instruct/RL proxy models。 输出: signal × scale × dosage AUC heatmap(论文Figure\n357\t    2)。\n358\t\n359\t    '\n360\t  expected_results:\n361\t    S1_d005_auc_05B_mean: 0.979\n362\t    S2_d005_auc_05B_mean: 0.465\n363\t    S4_d005_auc_05B_mean: 0.481\n364\t    S1_d100_cross_cohens_d_05B: 3.6\n365\t    S2_d100_cross_cohens_d_05B: -1.98\n366\t    S4_d100_cross_cohens_d_05B: 0.45\n367\t    effective_signals_at_05B: 1\n368\t    S1_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.97\n369\t    S2_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.72\n370\t    S4_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.7\n371\t    S1_d100_cross_cohens_d_15B: 3.85\n372\t    S2_d100_cross_cohens_d_15B: -1.52\n373\t    S4_d100_cross_cohens_d_15B: 0.88\n374\t    effective_signals_at_15B: 3\n375\t    S1_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.98\n376\t    S2_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.8\n377\t    S4_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.77\n378\t    S1_d100_cross_cohens_d_3B: 4.2\n379\t    S2_d100_cross_cohens_d_3B: -2.31\n380\t    S4_d100_cross_cohens_d_3B: 1.15\n381\t    effective_signals_at_3B: 3\n382\t    S4_instruct_vs_base_sensitivity: 0.68\n383\t    S2_instruct_degradation_pct: 15\n384\t    S1_instruct_stable: true\n385\t    s2_auc_070_threshold_scale: ~1.2B (interpolated)\n386\t    s4_auc_070_threshold_scale: ~1.4B (interpolated)\n387\t  result_rationale: '(a) Signal survival pattern由model capacity驱动：0.5B缺乏token-level\n388\t    memorization depth(S2 fails)和metacognitive self-evaluation(S4 fails)。1.5B是transition\n389\t    point—— S2/S4 emergent capabilities使AUC跨过0.70 practical threshold。3B consolidates。\n390\t    S1(embedding retrieval)依赖external encoder，始终stable。 (b) Min-K++ reversal机制：d100将所有items加入training\n391\t    data，模型的token-level distribution 整体shift。Min-K++基于\"low perplexity tokens\"检测memorization，但当EVERYTHING\n392\t    is memorized， baseline perplexity distribution itself shifts→clean items的relative\n393\t    perplexity paradoxically更接近contaminated profile→reversal。3B模型更充分学习d100 distribution→\n394\t    reversal更强(d=-2.31 vs 0.5B d=-1.98)。 (c) S4(Self-Critique)d100 cross-model Cohen''s\n395\t    d从0.5B=0.45增至3B=1.15： larger models的self-evaluation对contaminated items更consistently\n396\t    confident， cross-model effect size增长。 (d) Instruct/RL proxy: Instruct models经过RLHF/DPO，token-level\n397\t    distributions 进一步shift。S2(Min-K++)在Instruct models上AUC降低~15%(perplexity patterns被RLHF扰动)，\n398\t    但S4(Self-Critique)在Instruct models上因为enhanced instruction-following能力 实际上更有效(sensitivity=0.68)。S1保持stable因为embedding\n399\t    retrieval不依赖target model。 (e) Scale transition thresholds通过linear interpolation估计：S2在~1.2B达到AUC=0.70，\n400\t    S4在~1.4B。这与LLM capability emergence literature一致。\n401\t\n402\t    '\n403\t  tables:\n404\t  - name: 'Table: Full Signal × Scale × Dosage AUC Matrix'\n405\t    description: 'Grand matrix: 3 signals(S1/S2/S4) × 3 scales(0.5B/1.5B/3B) × 3 dosages(d005/d025/d100)\n406\t      × 3 benchmarks(MMLU/ARC/GSM8K)。d005 cells = within-model AUC; d100 cells = cross-model\n407\t      Cohen''s d。Color: green/yellow/red threshold coding。\n408\t\n409\t      '\n410\t  - name: 'Table: Instruct/RL Proxy Signal Comparison'\n411\t    description: 'Rows: Base, Instruct, RL-proxy。Columns: S1/S2/S4 sensitivity metrics。\n412\t\n413\t      '\n414\t  figures_description:\n415\t  - 'Figure 2 (论文核心图): Signal × Scale AUC heatmap。 3×3 grid (signal rows × scale columns)。Cell\n416\t    color = AUC intensity。 Clear green diagonal from bottom-left(S1/0.5B: green) to\n417\t    top-right(S4/3B: green)。 S2/S4 at 0.5B: red cells。Visual证据for scale-dependent\n418\t    emergence。'\n419\t  - 'Min-K++ reversal visualization: Paired violin plots showing S2 score distributions\n420\t    for d000 vs d100 at each scale。Distribution overlap at d000; clear INVERSION at\n421\t    d100 (contaminated items scored LOWER than clean)。'\n422\t  analysis: 'exp-008是Core Contribution #2的实证基础。3个key findings： (1) Scale-dependent\n423\t    emergence: S2/S4从0.5B random(AUC≈0.47)到3B effective(AUC≈0.80/0.77)， transition\n424\t    at ~1.2-1.4B。这不是arbitrary——对应LLM capability emergence in memorization and metacognition。\n425\t    (2) Min-K++ reversal(d=-1.98 at 0.5B, d=-2.31 at 3B): 最强citation-worthy发现。 Warning:\n426\t    naive use of Min-K++ at high contamination ACTIVELY MISLEADS。机制analysis (全量memorization→perplexity\n427\t    distribution shift→reversal)提供explanatory depth。 (3) Item-level vs cross-model\n428\t    detection范式区分：d005用within-model AUC(item discrimination)， d100用cross-model Cohen''s\n429\t    d(model discrimination)。d100 AUC=0.5是labeling artifact (all items contaminated→no\n430\t    discriminative labels)，不是signal failure。\n431\t\n432\t    '\n433\t- name: rl_observational_case_study\n434\t  plan_id: exp-009\n435\t  description: '对existing RL-trained models (Qwen2.5-Instruct 0.5B/1.5B/3B/7B, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B/7B)\n436\t    应用ContamCal pipeline。 Observational study——directional external validity, not\n437\t    full quantitative validation。 Near-zero γ check on known-clean benchmark作为specificity\n438\t    test。\n439\t\n440\t    '\n441\t  expected_results:\n442\t    S1_auc_instruct_3B: 0.94\n443\t    S2_auc_instruct_3B: 0.62\n444\t    S4_auc_instruct_3B: 0.71\n445\t    S1_auc_deepseek_r1_7B: 0.91\n446\t    gamma_mmlu_instruct_models: 0.18\n447\t    gamma_mmlu_instruct_ci_width: 0.22\n448\t    gamma_arc_instruct_models: 0.25\n449\t    gamma_arc_instruct_ci_width: 0.19\n450\t    gamma_mmlu_deepseek_r1: 0.14\n451\t    gamma_mmlu_deepseek_ci_width: 0.28\n452\t    gamma_clean_benchmark_mean: 0.02\n453\t    gamma_clean_benchmark_ci_includes_zero: true\n454\t    specificity_pass: true\n455\t    top5_selection_changes_uncal_vs_cal: 2\n456\t    top5_selection_changes_cal_vs_remove_rescore: 1\n457\t    regret_reduction_pct: 35\n458\t    ci_width_rl_vs_sft_ratio: 1.8\n459\t  result_rationale: '(a) Signal quality on RL models degraded但non-trivially：RLHF/DPO改变token-level\n460\t    distributions使S2(Min-K++)AUC降至0.62(from SFT baseline ~0.80 at 3B)——RL optimization\n461\t    partially erases memorization traces。S4(Self-Critique)更robust(AUC=0.71)因为 RLHF\n462\t    actually enhances self-evaluation capability。S1(embedding)保持高AUC(0.94) 因为independent\n463\t    of target model。 (b) γ estimates with wide CIs(width 0.19-0.28 vs SFT的~0.06-0.08)：\n464\t    RL models的exposure scores更noisy(S2 degraded)→ME model propagates这些noise into wider\n465\t    posteriors。这是honest uncertainty——calibration精度受限于input signal quality， 系统正确报告了这种limitation。\n466\t    (c) Instruct models γ_mmlu=0.18(moderate)：RL post-training未fully消除SFT-phase contamination。Qwen2.5-Instruct很可能在SFT\n467\t    phase包含了benchmark-adjacent data。 γ比controlled SFT experiments低(0.28)因为RL optimization\n468\t    partially corrects memorized shortcuts。 (d) DeepSeek-R1-Distill γ=0.14 with wider\n469\t    CI：reasoning-distilled model的contamination profile不同于standard RLHF。更宽CI反映更不确定的exposure\n470\t    estimation。 (e) Specificity pass(γ_clean≈0.02, CI includes 0)：关键validation——ContamCal不会\n471\t    对genuinely clean benchmarks产生false positive校准adjustment。 (f) Expected regret:\n472\t    top-5 model selection中2 changes表明calibration有practical impact。 Regret reduction\n473\t    35%源于高contamination model被correctly downranked。\n474\t\n475\t    '\n476\t  tables:\n477\t  - name: 'Table: RL Model Calibration Results'\n478\t    description: 'Rows: 6 RL models。Columns: Raw score, Calibrated score, 95% CI,\n479\t      γ estimate, Signal AUC(S1/S2/S4), CI width ratio vs SFT。\n480\t\n481\t      '\n482\t  - name: 'Table: Expected Regret Analysis'\n483\t    description: 'Top-5 rankings under: Raw, Remove-rescore, ContamCal。 Highlight\n484\t      position changes and regret scores。\n485\t\n486\t      '\n487\t  figures_description:\n488\t  - 'RL model CI comparison: Bar chart showing calibrated scores with 95% CI whiskers\n489\t    for RL models alongside SFT controlled models。RL model CIs visibly wider—— honest\n490\t    uncertainty propagation。'\n491\t  analysis: 'Observational case study提供directional external validity。Key insights:\n492\t    (1) RL post-training partially但未完全消除SFT-phase contamination(γ>0 for RL models)。\n493\t    (2) ContamCal honestly widens CIs when signal quality degrades(CI width ratio\n494\t    1.8×)—— 这是feature not bug，正确反映epistemic uncertainty。 (3) Specificity test通过确认framework不会over-calibrate\n495\t    clean benchmarks。 (4) 2 top-5 ranking changes demonstrate practical impact for\n496\t    model selection decisions。 Framed as \"directional\"——no ground truth for RL models,\n497\t    acknowledged in Limitations。\n498\t\n499\t    '\n500\t- name: observational_72b\n501\t  plan_id: exp-012\n502\t  description: 'Qwen2.5-72B inference-only observational分析。 No SFT injection(compute\n503\t    prohibitive)——纯推理+signal computation+IRT calibration。 Extends ecological validity\n504\t    to frontier model scale。\n505\t\n506\t    '\n507\t  expected_results:\n508\t    raw_mmlu_72B: 0.847\n509\t    raw_gsm8k_72B: 0.912\n510\t    raw_arc_72B: 0.935\n511\t    raw_humaneval_72B: 0.61\n512\t    S1_exposure_summary_high_pct: 0.12\n513\t    S2_auc_proxy_72B: 0.88\n514\t    S4_auc_proxy_72B: 0.85\n515\t    calibrated_mmlu_72B: 0.831\n516\t    calibrated_mmlu_ci_lower: 0.805\n517\t    calibrated_mmlu_ci_upper: 0.858\n518\t    calibrated_arc_72B: 0.928\n519\t    calibrated_gsm8k_72B: 0.908\n520\t    gamma_adjustment_mmlu_pp: -1.6\n521\t    gamma_adjustment_arc_pp: -0.7\n522\t    gamma_adjustment_gsm8k_pp: -0.4\n523\t    inference_time_hours: 8\n524\t  result_rationale: '(a) 72B raw scores接近ceiling(MMLU 84.7%, ARC 93.5%)。Contamination\n525\t    adjustment 相对modest(MMLU -1.6pp, ARC -0.7pp)——frontier models的high performance\n526\t    partly comes from genuine capability, with moderate contamination inflation。 (b)\n527\t    Signal quality at 72B最强：S2 AUC proxy=0.88, S4=0.85。Largest models have deepest\n528\t    memorization traces and strongest self-evaluation。 (c) CalibrationCI width moderate(MMLU:\n529\t    ±2.7pp)因为observational setting lacks controlled ground truth——IRT model borrows\n530\t    strength from SFT-controlled models但72B θ is extrapolated beyond training data\n531\t    range。 (d) GSM8K adjustment minimal(-0.4pp)——consistent with γ_gsm8k≈0.06 from\n532\t    controlled experiments and 72B''s genuine strong reasoning ability。\n533\t\n534\t    '\n535\t  tables:\n536\t  - name: 'Table: 72B Observational Calibration'\n537\t    description: 'Single model row: Raw vs Calibrated for 4 benchmarks, with 95% CI。\n538\t      Context row: adjustment magnitude interpretation。\n539\t\n540\t      '\n541\t  figures_description:\n542\t  - 'Frontier model calibration forest plot: 72B的4 benchmarks raw(red) vs calibrated(blue)\n543\t    with CI bands。Modest but non-zero adjustments on MMLU/ARC, near-zero on GSM8K。'\n544\t  analysis: '72B observational case extends ContamCal''s applicability to frontier\n545\t    models without requiring prohibitive SFT runs。Key finding: even frontier models\n546\t    show detectable contamination signals, with calibrated MMLU -1.6pp suggesting\n547\t    ~2% inflation。 Wide CIs appropriately reflect observational uncertainty。 Framed\n548\t    as ecological validity extension, not primary quantitative validation。\n549\t\n550\t    '\n551\t- name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n552\t  plan_id: exp-013\n553\t  description: 'Degraded 2-signal mode(ConStat + Self-Critique, no logits/embeddings)\n554\t    for closed-weight models where S1(embedding of training data)和S2(Min-K++, needs\n555\t    logits) 不可用。量化2-signal vs 4-signal calibration accuracy gap。\n556\t\n557\t    '\n558\t  expected_results:\n559\t    composite_auc_2sig_3B_mmlu: 0.79\n560\t    composite_auc_2sig_3B_arc: 0.82\n561\t    composite_auc_2sig_3B_gsm8k: 0.74\n562\t    mae_2sig_pp: 3.4\n563\t    ci_coverage_95_2sig: 87\n564\t    ci_sharpness_2sig_pp: 8.2\n565\t    kendall_tau_2sig: 0.84\n566\t    mae_gap_vs_4sig_pp: 1.3\n567\t    coverage_gap_vs_4sig_pct: 5\n568\t    ci_width_ratio_2sig_vs_4sig: 1.41\n569\t    mae_2sig_vs_dcr_improvement_pp: 1.2\n570\t    mae_2sig_vs_linear_reg_improvement_pp: 0.9\n571\t  result_rationale: '(a) 2-signal composite AUC 0.79-0.82 at 3B: S3(ConStat)和S4(Self-Critique)\n572\t    提供complementary information——ConStat检测performance gap between original vs paraphrased\n573\t    items(behavioral signal)，S4检测entropy collapse on familiar items(intrinsic signal)。\n574\t    两者不依赖logits或training data access，适用于closed-weight APIs。 (b) MAE从2.1pp退化到3.4pp(+1.3pp\n575\t    gap)：lower composite AUC→noisier exposure scores →γ估计less precise→calibration误差增加。但仍优于DCR(4.6pp)1.2pp——\n576\t    即使degraded mode, IRT框架的item-level resolution仍有价值。 (c) Coverage降至87%: exposure\n577\t    noise增加但ME model只能部分补偿 (2-signal noise structure不同于4-signal)。CI width增加41%反映更大的estimation\n578\t    uncertainty。 (d) Kendall τ=0.84(vs 4-signal 0.91): ranking preservation仍reasonable但degraded。\n579\t    高contamination models的calibration less precise导致更多ranking errors。\n580\t\n581\t    '\n582\t  tables:\n583\t  - name: 'Table: 2-signal vs 4-signal Calibration Comparison'\n584\t    description: 'Two rows(2-sig, 4-sig) × 6 metric columns。 Third row: gap magnitude\n585\t      and significance。\n586\t\n587\t      '\n588\t  figures_description:\n589\t  - 'Calibration accuracy vs number of signals: Line plot showing MAE as function\n590\t    of signal count(1, 2, 4)。Diminishing returns but clear improvement with more signals。'\n591\t  analysis: '2-signal mode在closed-weight regime仍优于所有non-IRT baselines(MAE 3.4 vs DCR\n592\t    4.6pp)。 1.3pp gap vs 4-signal mode quantifies the cost of limited model access。\n593\t    Practical recommendation: use 4-signal when logits available, 2-signal otherwise。\n594\t    CI width inflation(41%)honestly reflects reduced estimation precision。 Framed\n595\t    as \"extensible architecture for future signals\" in paper discussion。\n596\t\n597\t    '\n598\t- name: multi_family_validation\n599\t  plan_id: exp-014\n600\t  description: 'Controlled SFT injection on Llama-3.2-1B at 3 dosage levels(d000/d025/d100)。\n601\t    验证identifiability boundaries和calibration accuracy跨model family泛化。 Rebuttal-ready\n602\t    experiment。\n603\t\n604\t    '\n605\t  expected_results:\n606\t    sft_time_per_run_hours: 3\n607\t    total_gpu_hours: 9\n608\t    eval_d000_mmlu: 0.465\n609\t    eval_d000_arc: 0.578\n610\t    eval_d000_gsm8k: 0.342\n611\t    eval_d025_mmlu: 0.472\n612\t    eval_d025_arc: 0.589\n613\t    eval_d100_mmlu: 0.481\n614\t    eval_d100_arc: 0.602\n615\t    mmlu_inflation_d100_pp: 1.6\n616\t    arc_inflation_d100_pp: 2.4\n617\t    S1_auc_llama1B_d005: 0.96\n618\t    S2_auc_llama1B_d005: 0.58\n619\t    S4_auc_llama1B_d005: 0.55\n620\t    cross_family_gamma_k_correlation: 0.91\n621\t    gamma_k_mmlu_llama: 0.24\n622\t    gamma_k_arc_llama: 0.36\n623\t    gamma_k_gsm8k_llama: 0.05\n624\t    mae_llama_pp: 2.4\n625\t    ci_coverage_95_llama: 90\n626\t    fisher_info_threshold_match: true\n627\t    practical_auc_threshold_llama: 0.72\n628\t  result_rationale: '(a) Llama-3.2-1B at ~1B scale介于Qwen2.5-0.5B和1.5B之间。 S2/S4 AUC(0.58/0.55)低于Qwen\n629\t    1.5B(0.72/0.70)但高于Qwen 0.5B(0.47/0.48)—— 与scale-dependent emergence curve一致，不同architecture在同一capacity\n630\t    range有类似behavior。 (b) Contamination inflation(MMLU +1.6pp, ARC +2.4pp)与Qwen同scale范围一致。\n631\t    Llama和Qwen在contamination susceptibility上表现similar——confirmation that contamination\n632\t    effect is primarily a capacity/benchmark property, not architecture-specific。\n633\t    (c) Cross-family γ_k correlation r=0.91: per-benchmark contamination susceptibility\n634\t    ranking高度一致(ARC > MMLU >> GSM8K for both families)。这是\"contamination susceptibility\n635\t    is benchmark property\"的strongest evidence——如果它是model-family specific, r应该低。 (d)\n636\t    Fisher Info identifiability boundary在Llama上同样成立：practical AUC threshold=0.72 (vs\n637\t    Qwen 0.70)，structural threshold=0.55(identical)——theoretical framework generalizes。\n638\t    (e) MAE=2.4pp(vs Qwen 2.1pp): slightly worse因为1B scale有noisier signals， 但在best\n639\t    tier range(1.5-3.0pp)内。Coverage 90%也在range。\n640\t\n641\t    '\n642\t  tables:\n643\t  - name: 'Table: Cross-Family γ_k Comparison'\n644\t    description: 'Rows: MMLU, ARC, GSM8K, HumanEval。 Columns: Qwen γ_k (mean±CI),\n645\t      Llama γ_k (mean±CI), Pearson r。 Bottom: overall correlation r=0.91。\n646\t\n647\t      '\n648\t  - name: 'Table: Identifiability Boundary Cross-Family Comparison'\n649\t    description: 'Rows: Structural threshold, Practical threshold。 Columns: Qwen(observed),\n650\t      Llama(observed), Fisher Info(predicted)。\n651\t\n652\t      '\n653\t  figures_description:\n654\t  - 'Cross-family γ_k scatter: x=Qwen γ_k, y=Llama γ_k, per benchmark。 Strong positive\n655\t    correlation (r=0.91), regression line near identity。 Key visual: benchmarks cluster\n656\t    by susceptibility regardless of model family。'\n657\t  analysis: Multi-family validation是rebuttal的最强武器。r=0.91 cross-family correlation\n658\t    表明contamination susceptibility确实是benchmark property——ARC的MC format和limited item\n659\t    pool 使其比MMLU更susceptible(γ_k_ARC > γ_k_MMLU in both families)，GSM8K的open-ended\n660\t    format consistently resistant。Fisher Info thresholds跨family一致性确认theoretical framework的generality。如果reviewer要求\"show\n661\t    it works on non-Qwen models\"—— 这个实验直接回答，且结论更强(不仅works, 而且quantitatively consistent)。\n662\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9e2eb3c2-aea0-4799-9cc1-c104180c7ecf","uuid":"4698867b-a097-43c2-ba8d-fb6f0380b523","timestamp":"2026-05-14T19:50:35.726Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T185145/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始framing完全成立。三条Core Claims无需调整： (1) ContamCal校准在MAE、coverage、ranking三维度显著优于全部7个基线，counterfactual\n  exposure=0恢复真实分数，SBC诊断确认模型规格正确； (2) ''scale-dependent signal effectiveness''用多尺度AUC热力图完整呈现——S2(Min-K++)和S4(Self-Critique)在≥1.5B恢复AUC≥0.70，\n  Min-K++反向效应(Cohen''s d=-1.98 at 0.5B d100)作为最强citation-worthy发现，论文区分item-level AUC与cross-model\n  Cohen''s d两种检测范式； (3) Fisher Info identifiability分析的structural(AUC≥0.55)/practical(AUC≥0.70)阈值区分与144-condition\n  simulation和real-data验证一致。 per-benchmark γ_k异质性(CV>0.3)成为额外亮点——污染敏感性是benchmark属性而非模型属性。\n  RRF在≥1.5B多信号可用尺度展示真正的聚合价值(AUC提升+1.5-2pp vs best single signal)，在0.5B优雅退化为S1-only模式。\n  N_models通过multi-seed pooling达到≥30，Fisher Info预测的identifiability边界与实证吻合。 论文标题保持calibration框架定位。0.5B的SFT\n  degradation pattern(contamination hurts small models)作为有价值的empirical observation纳入分析。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '在exp-001产出的全部contaminated+clean模型(0.5B/1.5B/3B × d000/d005/d025/d100\n    × 2 seeds)上 计算4个detection signals: S1(embedding semantic retrieval), S2(Min-K%++),\n    S3(ConStat performance gap), S4(Self-Critique entropy collapse)。 0.5B数据已完成(exp_002_signals_05B)，此处展开1.5B和3B的预测。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    S1_auc_05B_d005_mmlu: 0.953\n    S1_auc_05B_d005_gsm8k: 0.988\n    S1_auc_05B_d005_arc: 0.995\n    S2_auc_05B_d005_mean: 0.465\n    S4_auc_05B_d005_mean: 0.481\n    S1_auc_15B_d005_mmlu: 0.965\n    S1_auc_15B_d005_gsm8k: 0.991\n    S1_auc_15B_d005_arc: 0.996\n    S2_auc_15B_d005_mmlu: 0.72\n    S2_auc_15B_d005_gsm8k: 0.68\n    S2_auc_15B_d005_arc: 0.74\n    S3_auc_15B_d005_mmlu: 0.67\n    S3_auc_15B_d005_arc: 0.71\n    S4_auc_15B_d005_mmlu: 0.7\n    S4_auc_15B_d005_gsm8k: 0.66\n    S4_auc_15B_d005_arc: 0.73\n    S1_auc_3B_d005_mmlu: 0.972\n    S1_auc_3B_d005_gsm8k: 0.993\n    S1_auc_3B_d005_arc: 0.997\n    S2_auc_3B_d005_mmlu: 0.8\n    S2_auc_3B_d005_gsm8k: 0.76\n    S2_auc_3B_d005_arc: 0.83\n    S3_auc_3B_d005_mmlu: 0.74\n    S3_auc_3B_d005_arc: 0.78\n    S4_auc_3B_d005_mmlu: 0.77\n    S4_auc_3B_d005_gsm8k: 0.73\n    S4_auc_3B_d005_arc: 0.8\n    S2_d100_cohens_d_15B_mmlu: -1.52\n    S2_d100_cohens_d_15B_arc: -1.38\n    S2_d100_cohens_d_3B_mmlu: -2.31\n    S2_d100_cohens_d_3B_arc: -2.67\n    signal_computation_time_per_model_hours: 1.5\n    total_gpu_hours: 18\n  result_rationale: 'S2(Min-K++)和S4(Self-Critique)的scale-dependent recovery机制： (a)\n    Min-K++依赖token-level perplexity异常检测memorization。0.5B模型容量不足， 即使见过contaminated paraphrases也难以形成持久的token-level记忆痕迹(AUC≈0.47)。\n    1.5B容量足以保留item-specific记忆，contaminated items呈现显著更低的token surprise(AUC→0.72)。 3B容量充裕，memorization痕迹更清晰(AUC→0.80)。\n    (b) Self-Critique依赖模型自我评估能力(entropy collapse on seen items)。0.5B的 self-evaluation不可靠(AUC≈0.48)。1.5B\n    emergence of metacognitive capability使得 模型对seen items表现出过度自信(更低entropy)，AUC→0.70。3B\n    self-evaluation更稳定(AUC→0.77)。 (c) S1(embedding retrieval)基于外部sentence-transformer匹配，不依赖目标模型能力，\n    因此AUC在所有scale一致≥0.95。 (d) Min-K++ d100 reversal持续且scale-dependent：d100将ALL items标记为contaminated，\n    模型整体token-level distribution向training data shift，导致clean items的perplexity 反而更接近contaminated\n    distribution→Min-K++反向判断。3B模型更充分地拟合d100 training data， reversal更强(Cohen''s d=-2.67)。\n    (e) S3(ConStat)在1.5B/3B恢复，因为larger models对original vs paraphrased items的 performance\n    gap更稳定、更可检测。0.5B的noise floor太高。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Signal AUC × Scale × Dosage Heatmap (d005 within-model)'\n    description: '4 signals × 3 scales × 3 benchmarks矩阵。Cells标注AUC值和95% bootstrap\n      CI。 Color coding: green(≥0.70), yellow(0.55-0.70), red(<0.55)。 展示S2/S4从0.5B\n      red到3B green的scale-dependent transition。\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-model Cohen''s d at d100 (d100 vs d000)'\n    description: '3 signals × 3 scales × 3 benchmarks。标注Cohen''s d值和方向箭头。 突出Min-K++\n      reversal: 0.5B d=-1.98, 3B d=-2.67。\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Signal exposure score distribution violin plots: 对每个signal/scale/dosage， 展示contaminated\n    vs clean items的exposure score分布。1.5B/3B S2/S4呈现清晰的 双峰分离(vs 0.5B完全重叠)。'\n  analysis: 'S2/S4在≥1.5B恢复effectiveness验证了''scale-dependent signal reliability''叙事。\n    这不仅是empirical observation——它反映了小模型(0.5B)缺乏足够capacity来形成 可检测的memorization痕迹或self-evaluation能力。ARC在所有signals表现最好(items最少、\n    contamination signal-to-noise ratio最高)。GSM8K的S2/S4 AUC略低于MMLU/ARC， 与open-ended\n    format降低memorization检测力一致。S1保持scale-invariant高AUC(≥0.95) 确认embedding retrieval作为robust\n    anchor signal。Min-K++ reversal随scale增强 (Cohen''s d从-1.52到-2.67)是论文最强citation-worthy发现——它证明了naively\n    relying on individual signals can ACTIVELY mislead(不仅仅是fail)。\n\n    '\n- name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: 'RRF融合4个signals为composite per-item exposure score。 消融实验: (a) RRF vs\n    equal-weight rank averaging, (b) single-signal only (×4), (c) calibration-based\n    weighted RRF, (d) FP injection robustness, (e) degraded 2-signal mode (ConStat+Self-Critique\n    for closed-weight).\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    rrf_composite_auc_05B_d005_mmlu: 0.955\n    rrf_composite_auc_05B_d005_arc: 0.995\n    rrf_vs_best_single_delta_05B: 0.002\n    rrf_composite_auc_15B_d005_mmlu: 0.975\n    rrf_composite_auc_15B_d005_arc: 0.998\n    rrf_vs_best_single_delta_15B: 0.015\n    rrf_composite_auc_3B_d005_mmlu: 0.985\n    rrf_composite_auc_3B_d005_arc: 0.999\n    rrf_vs_best_single_delta_3B: 0.02\n    rrf_vs_equal_weight_delta_auc_3B: 0.008\n    weighted_rrf_vs_rrf_delta_3B: 0.003\n    fp_injection_10pct_auc_retention: 0.96\n    fp_injection_20pct_auc_retention: 0.91\n    degraded_2signal_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.79\n    degraded_2signal_auc_3B_arc: 0.82\n    s1_only_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.972\n    s2_only_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.8\n    s3_only_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.74\n    s4_only_auc_3B_mmlu: 0.77\n  result_rationale: '(a) 0.5B regime: S2/S3/S4均≈random(AUC<0.55)，RRF退化为S1-only模式。\n    RRF composite AUC ≈ S1 AUC(+0.002)，因为random signals的RRF ranks 不系统性偏移有效S1的排序。这是graceful\n    degradation——RRF不会因无效信号 而比最佳单信号更差(rank fusion的鲁棒性)。 (b) 1.5B regime: S2/S4恢复(AUC\n    0.68-0.74)，RRF聚合3-4个above-chance signals。 Rank fusion的互补性在此显现：S1基于training-data\n    proximity，S2基于memorization trace， S4基于metacognition——不同failure modes提供正交information。AUC提升1.5pp\n    over S1-only。 (c) 3B regime: 4个signals全部AUC>0.74，RRF提升2.0pp over S1-only。这是RRF展示\n    genuine aggregation value的最佳展示区间。 (d) RRF vs equal-weight: RRF对高排名items给予更大权重(reciprocal\n    rank)， 优于uniform averaging 0.8pp——因为top-ranked items的agreement更informative。 (e)\n    Calibration-based weighted RRF仅+0.3pp over vanilla RRF——marginal improvement 不值得引入calibration\n    dependency(meta-circularity argument仍成立)。 (f) FP injection: RRF容忍10% FP rate(AUC保持96%)，20%时下降至91%。\n    Rank fusion对sparse FP鲁棒因为FP不会系统性地在多个signals中出现。 (g) 2-signal degraded mode(S3+S4,\n    no logits/embeddings): AUC 0.79-0.82 at 3B， sufficient for closed-weight calibration但CI会更宽。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: RRF Ablation Comparison (3B d005)'\n    description: 'Rows: RRF-4sig, RRF-3sig(no S3), S1-only, S2-only, S3-only, S4-only,\n      equal-weight, weighted-RRF, 2-signal(S3+S4)。 Columns: MMLU AUC, ARC AUC, GSM8K\n      AUC, Mean AUC, Δ vs S1-only。\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: FP Robustness (RRF AUC at varying FP injection rates)'\n    description: 'Rows: FP rate 0%, 5%, 10%, 15%, 20%。 Columns: MMLU, ARC, GSM8K composite\n      AUC。\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'RRF value-add bar chart: 3个scales的(RRF − best_single_signal) delta。 0.5B bar≈0，1.5B\n    bar=1.5pp，3B bar=2.0pp——清晰展示multi-signal aggregation value随scale emergence。'\n  analysis: 'RRF的真正价值在≥1.5B multi-signal regime中显现——当constituent signals各自捕获 不同contamination\n    facets时，rank fusion产生genuine information gain。在0.5B single-signal regime，RRF优雅退化且不引入harm(不比S1-only差)。\n    Meta-circularity argument得到empirical支持：calibration-based weighting仅+0.3pp， 远不值得引入对training\n    data quality的dependency。Training-free RRF保持设计选择定位。 2-signal mode在3B AUC≥0.79确认closed-weight\n    applicability。\n\n    '\n- name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: '在exp-001/003产出的controlled models上拟合4PL+γ IRT(Stan NUTS)。 PRIMARY:\n    per-benchmark fitting with per-benchmark γ_k。 ABLATION: joint fitting with global\n    γ, hierarchical γ_k ~ Normal(μ_γ, σ_γ)。 N_models ≥ 30 (3 scales × 4 dosages ×\n    2-3 seeds)。 Compare against 7 baselines。Report 6 evaluation metrics。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    max_rhat: 1.007\n    min_ess_gamma: 520\n    min_ess_theta: 380\n    divergent_transitions: 0\n    fit_time_mmlu_1000items_min: 35\n    fit_time_arc_1172items_min: 28\n    fit_time_gsm8k_1319items_min: 32\n    n_models_pooled: 32\n    gamma_k_mmlu_mean: 0.28\n    gamma_k_mmlu_sd: 0.06\n    gamma_k_arc_mean: 0.38\n    gamma_k_arc_sd: 0.07\n    gamma_k_gsm8k_mean: 0.06\n    gamma_k_gsm8k_sd: 0.04\n    gamma_k_humaneval_mean: 0.12\n    gamma_k_humaneval_sd: 0.08\n    gamma_k_cv_across_benchmarks: 0.52\n    gamma_ci_excludes_zero_mmlu: true\n    gamma_ci_excludes_zero_arc: true\n    gamma_ci_excludes_zero_gsm8k: false\n    gamma_ci_excludes_zero_humaneval: true\n    gamma_ci_excludes_zero_rate: 0.88\n    mae_contam_cal_pp_mean: 2.1\n    mae_contam_cal_pp_std: 0.4\n    ci_coverage_95pct: 92\n    ci_coverage_80pct: 82\n    ci_coverage_50pct: 53\n    ci_sharpness_avg_width_pp: 5.8\n    kendall_tau: 0.91\n    dose_response_monotonicity_violations: 0\n    sbc_rank_uniformity_pvalue: 0.23\n    mae_mmlu_pp: 1.8\n    mae_arc_pp: 2.3\n    mae_gsm8k_pp: 1.1\n    mae_humaneval_pp: 3.8\n    mae_raw_no_adjustment_pp: 9.2\n    mae_remove_rescore_pp: 6.8\n    mae_single_signal_2pl_gamma_pp: 3.9\n    mae_vanilla_4pl_no_gamma_pp: 7.4\n    mae_linear_regression_pp: 4.3\n    mae_emperor_mitigation_pp: 8.1\n    mae_dcr_pp: 4.6\n    mae_improvement_vs_dcr_pp: 2.5\n    mae_improvement_vs_best_baseline_pp: 1.8\n    mae_global_gamma_pp: 3.1\n    mae_hierarchical_gamma_pp: 2.3\n    hierarchical_mu_gamma: 0.22\n    hierarchical_sigma_gamma: 0.14\n    mae_oracle_gamma_pp: 1.4\n    oracle_vs_estimated_gap_pp: 0.7\n    ci_coverage_95_me_model: 93\n    ci_coverage_95_simple_model: 88\n    ci_sharpness_me_vs_simple_ratio: 1.12\n  result_rationale: '(a) NUTS收敛(R̂<1.01, ESS>400): exp-004 simulation sweep已在N=50/AUC=0.80验证\n    MCMC quality(0 divergence, max R̂=1.010, min ESS=439)。Real data N=32(multi-seed\n    pooling) 在simulation验证范围内。MMLU subsampled至1000 items降低计算负担同时保留statistical power。\n    (b) Per-benchmark γ_k heterogeneity(CV=0.52): ARC γ_k=0.38最大——science reasoning\n    MC items 格式固定且答案模式可记忆，contamination直接提升正确选项probability。MMLU γ_k=0.28中等—— 14K items\n    diversity dilutes per-item memorization benefit。GSM8K γ_k≈0.06—— open-ended generation\n    format天然抵抗contamination(即使见过问题，仍需自主推理得出答案)， 正确扮演negative control角色。HumanEval γ_k=0.12小——code\n    generation部分受益于pattern recall 但functional correctness仍需正确逻辑。 (c) γ CI排除0的rate=0.88(≈7/8\n    benchmark-conditions排除0)：MMLU/ARC/HumanEval排除0， GSM8K不排除(γ≈0.06±0.04, CI包含0)。这恰好验证了negative\n    control和contamination susceptibility is benchmark property的论点。 (d) MAE=2.1pp:\n    IRT通过item-level response patterns检测contamination效应——即使 average benchmark accuracy\n    change仅1-2pp(1.5B/3B MMLU)，contaminated items呈现 concentrated 15-20pp per-item\n    accuracy boost(被95% uncontaminated items稀释)。 IRT的γ_k × e_ij项精确捕获这种item-level effect。Counterfactual(e=0)移除此effect\n    后recovery误差主要来自：(i)θ-γ posterior correlation残余(~0.5pp)， (ii)item subsample noise\n    for MMLU(~0.3pp)，(iii)per-item exposure score noise(~0.5pp)。 (e) CI coverage 92%\n    vs nominal 95%: 3pp gap的主要来源是local independence violation (single model responds\n    to all items→item responses correlated through shared parameters)。 ME model通过propagating\n    exposure noise部分补偿(88%→93%)。SBC诊断p=0.23确认 model specification本身正确(coverage gap来自local\n    independence, not model misspecification)。 (f) Kendall τ=0.91: 校准后model ranking高度保留。少量ranking变化来自high-dosage\n    models的calibration adjustment。 (g) Dose-response monotonicity: γ effect单调递增(d005<d025<d100)，0\n    violations。 0.5B的negative overall accuracy与positive γ共存不违反单调性——γ衡量的是per-item contamination\n    benefit(正)，而θ降低反映overall SFT degradation(负)。 (h) DCR MAE=4.6pp vs ContamCal 2.1pp:\n    DCR缺乏per-item resolution和Bayesian UQ， 只能做benchmark-level fuzzy adjustment。Linear\n    regression MAE=4.3pp因为linear assumption 不能捕获IRT的nonlinear item-response relationship。\n    (i) Oracle γ gap=0.7pp: exposure score noise贡献了~0.7pp MAE overhead， 说明signal quality是calibration\n    precision的binding constraint。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Main Results — Calibration Metrics × 8 Methods'\n    description: 'Rows: Raw, Remove-rescore, Single-signal 2PL+γ, Vanilla 4PL, Linear\n      regression, Emperor mitigation, DCR, ContamCal(ours)。 Columns: MAE(pp)±bootstrap\n      CI, 95% Coverage, 80% Coverage, CI Width(pp), Kendall τ, Monotonicity violations。Bolded:\n      ContamCal wins on all metrics。 Bottom row: Δ vs DCR with significance marker。\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: Per-benchmark γ_k Estimates'\n    description: 'Rows: MMLU, ARC-Challenge, GSM8K, HumanEval。 Columns: γ_k posterior\n      mean, 95% CI, CI excludes 0?, effect size interpretation。 Highlight: CV(γ_k)=0.52，支撑''contamination\n      susceptibility is benchmark property''。\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: Calibration Metrics Decomposed by Benchmark'\n    description: 'Rows: 4 benchmarks。Columns: MAE, Coverage, Sharpness, per-benchmark\n      notes。 GSM8K row highlighted as negative control (γ≈0, MAE lowest)。\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: Model Ablation — Global γ vs Per-benchmark γ_k vs Hierarchical'\n    description: '3 rows × same metric columns。Per-benchmark γ_k primary; global γ\n      loses 1.0pp MAE; hierarchical γ_k intermediate (formal heterogeneity test)。\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure: Calibrated-vs-True accuracy scatter with CIs (main result figure)。 Each\n    point = one model-benchmark condition, x=ground-truth clean accuracy, y=ContamCal\n    calibrated accuracy, whiskers=95% CI。 Diagonal line=perfect calibration。Color\n    by benchmark。 Inset: residual histogram showing approximate normality with mean≈0,\n    sd≈2.1pp。'\n  - 'Figure: Dose-response curves (4 panels, one per benchmark)。 x=dosage(d000/d005/d025/d100),\n    y=accuracy。 Lines: Raw observed(red), ContamCal calibrated(blue), Ground truth\n    clean(green dashed)。 Shaded: 95% CI bands。Blue tracks green closely; red diverges\n    with dosage。'\n  - 'Figure: γ_k forest plot across benchmarks。 Horizontal bars showing posterior\n    mean and 95% CI for each benchmark''s γ_k。 Vertical dashed line at 0。GSM8K CI\n    crosses 0; others clearly positive。'\n  analysis: 'exp-006是论文核心实验。MAE=2.1pp(±0.4)显著优于DCR的4.6pp(Δ=2.5pp, p<0.01 bootstrap\n    test)。 Coverage 92%接近但未达95% nominal——SBC p=0.23确认这不是model misspecification， 而是local\n    independence violation的已知IRT limitation(single model→correlated item responses)。\n    ME model部分弥补(88%→93%)但complete correction需要更复杂的correlated-error model (超出本文scope，acknowledged\n    in Limitations)。Per-benchmark γ_k的CV=0.52是 论文的structural insight——contamination\n    susceptibility取决于benchmark format和content characteristics， 不是model property。Oracle\n    γ分析(gap=0.7pp)量化了detection signal quality的calibration ceiling—— future work的better\n    signals可directly translate to tighter calibration。\n\n    '\n- name: scale_bridging_7b\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-7B controlled SFT injection at 4 dosage levels(d000/d005/d025/d100)。\n    验证calibration accuracy和signal effectiveness scaling至7B。 LoRA SFT on 1×H100, ~6h\n    per run。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sft_time_per_run_hours: 6.5\n    total_gpu_hours: 26\n    sft_d000_final_loss: 0.92\n    sft_d100_final_loss: 0.98\n    eval_d000_mmlu: 0.735\n    eval_d000_gsm8k: 0.798\n    eval_d000_arc: 0.874\n    eval_d000_humaneval: 0.268\n    eval_d005_mmlu: 0.742\n    eval_d005_gsm8k: 0.801\n    eval_d005_arc: 0.882\n    eval_d025_mmlu: 0.756\n    eval_d025_arc: 0.893\n    eval_d100_mmlu: 0.779\n    eval_d100_gsm8k: 0.806\n    eval_d100_arc: 0.908\n    eval_d100_humaneval: 0.28\n    mmlu_inflation_pp: 4.4\n    arc_inflation_pp: 3.4\n    gsm8k_inflation_pp: 0.8\n    S1_auc_7B_d005_mean: 0.978\n    S2_auc_7B_d005_mean: 0.85\n    S4_auc_7B_d005_mean: 0.82\n    S2_d100_cohens_d_7B: -2.85\n    mae_with_7B_pp: 2.0\n    ci_coverage_95_with_7B: 93\n    gamma_k_mmlu_with_7B: 0.31\n    gamma_k_arc_with_7B: 0.4\n  result_rationale: '(a) 7B contamination inflation更大(MMLU +4.4pp, ARC +3.4pp vs 1.5B/3B的<2pp)：\n    7B capacity足以在LoRA SFT中同时维持general capability和memorize contaminated items。 0.5B/1.5B/3B的smaller\n    capacity forced a tradeoff(0.5B: memorization hurts general, 1.5B/3B: memorization\n    barely helps)。7B跨过了capacity threshold使memorization productively translate to benchmark\n    inflation。这验证了contamination是real-world concern at practical model scales。 (b)\n    GSM8K inflation仅0.8pp：7B对GSM8K的CoT reasoning在SFT后保持稳定(vs 3B catastrophic forgetting)，但open-ended\n    format仍然抵抗contamination inflation。 (c) S2/S4 AUC在7B进一步提升(S2: 0.85, S4: 0.82)：更大模型的memorization痕迹更深，\n    token-level signals更清晰。Min-K++ reversal也更强(Cohen''s d=-2.85)——7B更充分拟合 d100 training\n    data distribution。 (d) Adding 7B to IRT pool(N_models→38-40)改善calibration(MAE\n    2.1→2.0pp, coverage 92→93%)： 更多examinees + wider ability range改善θ estimation和γ\n    identifiability。 γ_k_mmlu增加(0.28→0.31)因为7B贡献了更清晰的contamination signal。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 7B Dose-Response Accuracy'\n    description: 'Rows: d000, d005, d025, d100。Columns: MMLU, ARC, GSM8K, HumanEval。\n      Compare inflation pattern with 0.5B/1.5B/3B。\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Multi-scale dose-response overlay: 4 scales(0.5B-7B)在MMLU上的dose-response curves\n    叠加显示。0.5B下降趋势、1.5B/3B平坦、7B明显上升——capacity threshold for productive memorization。'\n  analysis: '7B数据是scale-bridging的关键——它证明了contamination inflation随model capacity增长，\n    在practical model sizes(7B)处达到可测量且需要校准的水平(MMLU +4.4pp)。 同时S2/S4 AUC进一步提升验证了scale-dependent\n    signal narrative的completeness。 7B加入IRT pool后calibration quality marginal improvement表明N=32已接近saturation。\n\n    '\n- name: signal_survival_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: '系统评估detection signal reliability across scales和dosages。 0.5B数据已完成(exp_008_signal_survival_v4)。\n    扩展到1.5B/3B + Instruct/RL proxy models。 输出: signal × scale × dosage AUC heatmap(论文Figure\n    2)。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    S1_d005_auc_05B_mean: 0.979\n    S2_d005_auc_05B_mean: 0.465\n    S4_d005_auc_05B_mean: 0.481\n    S1_d100_cross_cohens_d_05B: 3.6\n    S2_d100_cross_cohens_d_05B: -1.98\n    S4_d100_cross_cohens_d_05B: 0.45\n    effective_signals_at_05B: 1\n    S1_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.97\n    S2_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.72\n    S4_d005_auc_15B_mean: 0.7\n    S1_d100_cross_cohens_d_15B: 3.85\n    S2_d100_cross_cohens_d_15B: -1.52\n    S4_d100_cross_cohens_d_15B: 0.88\n    effective_signals_at_15B: 3\n    S1_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.98\n    S2_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.8\n    S4_d005_auc_3B_mean: 0.77\n    S1_d100_cross_cohens_d_3B: 4.2\n    S2_d100_cross_cohens_d_3B: -2.31\n    S4_d100_cross_cohens_d_3B: 1.15\n    effective_signals_at_3B: 3\n    S4_instruct_vs_base_sensitivity: 0.68\n    S2_instruct_degradation_pct: 15\n    S1_instruct_stable: true\n    s2_auc_070_threshold_scale: ~1.2B (interpolated)\n    s4_auc_070_threshold_scale: ~1.4B (interpolated)\n  result_rationale: '(a) Signal survival pattern由model capacity驱动：0.5B缺乏token-level\n    memorization depth(S2 fails)和metacognitive self-evaluation(S4 fails)。1.5B是transition\n    point—— S2/S4 emergent capabilities使AUC跨过0.70 practical threshold。3B consolidates。\n    S1(embedding retrieval)依赖external encoder，始终stable。 (b) Min-K++ reversal机制：d100将所有items加入training\n    data，模型的token-level distribution 整体shift。Min-K++基于\"low perplexity tokens\"检测memorization，但当EVERYTHING\n    is memorized， baseline perplexity distribution itself shifts→clean items的relative\n    perplexity paradoxically更接近contaminated profile→reversal。3B模型更充分学习d100 distribution→\n    reversal更强(d=-2.31 vs 0.5B d=-1.98)。 (c) S4(Self-Critique)d100 cross-model Cohen''s\n    d从0.5B=0.45增至3B=1.15： larger models的self-evaluation对contaminated items更consistently\n    confident， cross-model effect size增长。 (d) Instruct/RL proxy: Instruct models经过RLHF/DPO，token-level\n    distributions 进一步shift。S2(Min-K++)在Instruct models上AUC降低~15%(perplexity patterns被RLHF扰动)，\n    但S4(Self-Critique)在Instruct models上因为enhanced instruction-following能力 实际上更有效(sensitivity=0.68)。S1保持stable因为embedding\n    retrieval不依赖target model。 (e) Scale transition thresholds通过linear interpolation估计：S2在~1.2B达到AUC=0.70，\n    S4在~1.4B。这与LLM capability emergence literature一致。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Full Signal × Scale × Dosage AUC Matrix'\n    description: 'Grand matrix: 3 signals(S1/S2/S4) × 3 scales(0.5B/1.5B/3B) × 3 dosages(d005/d025/d100)\n      × 3 benchmarks(MMLU/ARC/GSM8K)。d005 cells = within-model AUC; d100 cells = cross-model\n      Cohen''s d。Color: green/yellow/red threshold coding。\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: Instruct/RL Proxy Signal Comparison'\n    description: 'Rows: Base, Instruct, RL-proxy。Columns: S1/S2/S4 sensitivity metrics。\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 2 (论文核心图): Signal × Scale AUC heatmap。 3×3 grid (signal rows × scale columns)。Cell\n    color = AUC intensity。 Clear green diagonal from bottom-left(S1/0.5B: green) to\n    top-right(S4/3B: green)。 S2/S4 at 0.5B: red cells。Visual证据for scale-dependent\n    emergence。'\n  - 'Min-K++ reversal visualization: Paired violin plots showing S2 score distributions\n    for d000 vs d100 at each scale。Distribution overlap at d000; clear INVERSION at\n    d100 (contaminated items scored LOWER than clean)。'\n  analysis: 'exp-008是Core Contribution #2的实证基础。3个key findings： (1) Scale-dependent\n    emergence: S2/S4从0.5B random(AUC≈0.47)到3B effective(AUC≈0.80/0.77)， transition\n    at ~1.2-1.4B。这不是arbitrary——对应LLM capability emergence in memorization and metacognition。\n    (2) Min-K++ reversal(d=-1.98 at 0.5B, d=-2.31 at 3B): 最强citation-worthy发现。 Warning:\n    naive use of Min-K++ at high contamination ACTIVELY MISLEADS。机制analysis (全量memorization→perplexity\n    distribution shift→reversal)提供explanatory depth。 (3) Item-level vs cross-model\n    detection范式区分：d005用within-model AUC(item discrimination)， d100用cross-model Cohen''s\n    d(model discrimination)。d100 AUC=0.5是labeling artifact (all items contaminated→no\n    discriminative labels)，不是signal failure。\n\n    '\n- name: rl_observational_case_study\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: '对existing RL-trained models (Qwen2.5-Instruct 0.5B/1.5B/3B/7B, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B/7B)\n    应用ContamCal pipeline。 Observational study——directional external validity, not\n    full quantitative validation。 Near-zero γ check on known-clean benchmark作为specificity\n    test。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    S1_auc_instruct_3B: 0.94\n    S2_auc_instruct_3B: 0.62\n    S4_auc_instruct_3B: 0.71\n    S1_auc_deepseek_r1_7B: 0.91\n    gamma_mmlu_instruct_models: 0.18\n    gamma_mmlu_instruct_ci_width: 0.22\n    gamma_arc_instruct_models: 0.25\n    gamma_arc_instruct_ci_width: 0.19\n    gamma_mmlu_deepseek_r1: 0.14\n    gamma_mmlu_deepseek_ci_width: 0.28\n    gamma_clean_benchmark_mean: 0.02\n    gamma_clean_benchmark_ci_includes_zero: true\n    specificity_pass: true\n    top5_selection_changes_uncal_vs_cal: 2\n    top5_selection_changes_cal_vs_remove_rescore: 1\n    regret_reduction_pct: 35\n    ci_width_rl_vs_sft_ratio: 1.8\n  result_rationale: '(a) Signal quality on RL models degraded但non-trivially：RLHF/DPO改变token-level\n    distributions使S2(Min-K++)AUC降至0.62(from SFT baseline ~0.80 at 3B)——RL optimization\n    partially erases memorization traces。S4(Self-Critique)更robust(AUC=0.71)因为 RLHF\n    actually enhances self-evaluation capability。S1(embedding)保持高AUC(0.94) 因为independent\n    of target model。 (b) γ estimates with wide CIs(width 0.19-0.28 vs SFT的~0.06-0.08)：\n    RL models的exposure scores更noisy(S2 degraded)→ME model propagates这些noise into wider\n    posteriors。这是honest uncertainty——calibration精度受限于input signal quality， 系统正确报告了这种limitation。\n    (c) Instruct models γ_mmlu=0.18(moderate)：RL post-training未fully消除SFT-phase contamination。Qwen2.5-Instruct很可能在SFT\n    phase包含了benchmark-adjacent data。 γ比controlled SFT experiments低(0.28)因为RL optimization\n    partially corrects memorized shortcuts。 (d) DeepSeek-R1-Distill γ=0.14 with wider\n    CI：reasoning-distilled model的contamination profile不同于standard RLHF。更宽CI反映更不确定的exposure\n    estimation。 (e) Specificity pass(γ_clean≈0.02, CI includes 0)：关键validation——ContamCal不会\n    对genuinely clean benchmarks产生false positive校准adjustment。 (f) Expected regret:\n    top-5 model selection中2 changes表明calibration有practical impact。 Regret reduction\n    35%源于高contamination model被correctly downranked。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: RL Model Calibration Results'\n    description: 'Rows: 6 RL models。Columns: Raw score, Calibrated score, 95% CI,\n      γ estimate, Signal AUC(S1/S2/S4), CI width ratio vs SFT。\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: Expected Regret Analysis'\n    description: 'Top-5 rankings under: Raw, Remove-rescore, ContamCal。 Highlight\n      position changes and regret scores。\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'RL model CI comparison: Bar chart showing calibrated scores with 95% CI whiskers\n    for RL models alongside SFT controlled models。RL model CIs visibly wider—— honest\n    uncertainty propagation。'\n  analysis: 'Observational case study提供directional external validity。Key insights:\n    (1) RL post-training partially但未完全消除SFT-phase contamination(γ>0 for RL models)。\n    (2) ContamCal honestly widens CIs when signal quality degrades(CI width ratio\n    1.8×)—— 这是feature not bug，正确反映epistemic uncertainty。 (3) Specificity test通过确认framework不会over-calibrate\n    clean benchmarks。 (4) 2 top-5 ranking changes demonstrate practical impact for\n    model selection decisions。 Framed as \"directional\"——no ground truth for RL models,\n    acknowledged in Limitations。\n\n    '\n- name: observational_72b\n  plan_id: exp-012\n  description: 'Qwen2.5-72B inference-only observational分析。 No SFT injection(compute\n    prohibitive)——纯推理+signal computation+IRT calibration。 Extends ecological validity\n    to frontier model scale。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    raw_mmlu_72B: 0.847\n    raw_gsm8k_72B: 0.912\n    raw_arc_72B: 0.935\n    raw_humaneval_72B: 0.61\n    S1_exposure_summary_high_pct: 0.12\n    S2_auc_proxy_72B: 0.88\n    S4_auc_proxy_72B: 0.85\n    calibrated_mmlu_72B: 0.831\n    calibrated_mmlu_ci_lower: 0.805\n    calibrated_mmlu_ci_upper: 0.858\n    calibrated_arc_72B: 0.928\n    calibrated_gsm8k_72B: 0.908\n    gamma_adjustment_mmlu_pp: -1.6\n    gamma_adjustment_arc_pp: -0.7\n    gamma_adjustment_gsm8k_pp: -0.4\n    inference_time_hours: 8\n  result_rationale: '(a) 72B raw scores接近ceiling(MMLU 84.7%, ARC 93.5%)。Contamination\n    adjustment 相对modest(MMLU -1.6pp, ARC -0.7pp)——frontier models的high performance\n    partly comes from genuine capability, with moderate contamination inflation。 (b)\n    Signal quality at 72B最强：S2 AUC proxy=0.88, S4=0.85。Largest models have deepest\n    memorization traces and strongest self-evaluation。 (c) CalibrationCI width moderate(MMLU:\n    ±2.7pp)因为observational setting lacks controlled ground truth——IRT model borrows\n    strength from SFT-controlled models但72B θ is extrapolated beyond training data\n    range。 (d) GSM8K adjustment minimal(-0.4pp)——consistent with γ_gsm8k≈0.06 from\n    controlled experiments and 72B''s genuine strong reasoning ability。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 72B Observational Calibration'\n    description: 'Single model row: Raw vs Calibrated for 4 benchmarks, with 95% CI。\n      Context row: adjustment magnitude interpretation。\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Frontier model calibration forest plot: 72B的4 benchmarks raw(red) vs calibrated(blue)\n    with CI bands。Modest but non-zero adjustments on MMLU/ARC, near-zero on GSM8K。'\n  analysis: '72B observational case extends ContamCal''s applicability to frontier\n    models without requiring prohibitive SFT runs。Key finding: even frontier models\n    show detectable contamination signals, with calibrated MMLU -1.6pp suggesting\n    ~2% inflation。 Wide CIs appropriately reflect observational uncertainty。 Framed\n    as ecological validity extension, not primary quantitative validation。\n\n    '\n- name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n  plan_id: exp-013\n  description: 'Degraded 2-signal mode(ConStat + Self-Critique, no logits/embeddings)\n    for closed-weight models where S1(embedding of training data)和S2(Min-K++, needs\n    logits) 不可用。量化2-signal vs 4-signal calibration accuracy gap。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    composite_auc_2sig_3B_mmlu: 0.79\n    composite_auc_2sig_3B_arc: 0.82\n    composite_auc_2sig_3B_gsm8k: 0.74\n    mae_2sig_pp: 3.4\n    ci_coverage_95_2sig: 87\n    ci_sharpness_2sig_pp: 8.2\n    kendall_tau_2sig: 0.84\n    mae_gap_vs_4sig_pp: 1.3\n    coverage_gap_vs_4sig_pct: 5\n    ci_width_ratio_2sig_vs_4sig: 1.41\n    mae_2sig_vs_dcr_improvement_pp: 1.2\n    mae_2sig_vs_linear_reg_improvement_pp: 0.9\n  result_rationale: '(a) 2-signal composite AUC 0.79-0.82 at 3B: S3(ConStat)和S4(Self-Critique)\n    提供complementary information——ConStat检测performance gap between original vs paraphrased\n    items(behavioral signal)，S4检测entropy collapse on familiar items(intrinsic signal)。\n    两者不依赖logits或training data access，适用于closed-weight APIs。 (b) MAE从2.1pp退化到3.4pp(+1.3pp\n    gap)：lower composite AUC→noisier exposure scores →γ估计less precise→calibration误差增加。但仍优于DCR(4.6pp)1.2pp——\n    即使degraded mode, IRT框架的item-level resolution仍有价值。 (c) Coverage降至87%: exposure\n    noise增加但ME model只能部分补偿 (2-signal noise structure不同于4-signal)。CI width增加41%反映更大的estimation\n    uncertainty。 (d) Kendall τ=0.84(vs 4-signal 0.91): ranking preservation仍reasonable但degraded。\n    高contamination models的calibration less precise导致更多ranking errors。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 2-signal vs 4-signal Calibration Comparison'\n    description: 'Two rows(2-sig, 4-sig) × 6 metric columns。 Third row: gap magnitude\n      and significance。\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Calibration accuracy vs number of signals: Line plot showing MAE as function\n    of signal count(1, 2, 4)。Diminishing returns but clear improvement with more signals。'\n  analysis: '2-signal mode在closed-weight regime仍优于所有non-IRT baselines(MAE 3.4 vs DCR\n    4.6pp)。 1.3pp gap vs 4-signal mode quantifies the cost of limited model access。\n    Practical recommendation: use 4-signal when logits available, 2-signal otherwise。\n    CI width inflation(41%)honestly reflects reduced estimation precision。 Framed\n    as \"extensible architecture for future signals\" in paper discussion。\n\n    '\n- name: multi_family_validation\n  plan_id: exp-014\n  description: 'Controlled SFT injection on Llama-3.2-1B at 3 dosage levels(d000/d025/d100)。\n    验证identifiability boundaries和calibration accuracy跨model family泛化。 Rebuttal-ready\n    experiment。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sft_time_per_run_hours: 3\n    total_gpu_hours: 9\n    eval_d000_mmlu: 0.465\n    eval_d000_arc: 0.578\n    eval_d000_gsm8k: 0.342\n    eval_d025_mmlu: 0.472\n    eval_d025_arc: 0.589\n    eval_d100_mmlu: 0.481\n    eval_d100_arc: 0.602\n    mmlu_inflation_d100_pp: 1.6\n    arc_inflation_d100_pp: 2.4\n    S1_auc_llama1B_d005: 0.96\n    S2_auc_llama1B_d005: 0.58\n    S4_auc_llama1B_d005: 0.55\n    cross_family_gamma_k_correlation: 0.91\n    gamma_k_mmlu_llama: 0.24\n    gamma_k_arc_llama: 0.36\n    gamma_k_gsm8k_llama: 0.05\n    mae_llama_pp: 2.4\n    ci_coverage_95_llama: 90\n    fisher_info_threshold_match: true\n    practical_auc_threshold_llama: 0.72\n  result_rationale: '(a) Llama-3.2-1B at ~1B scale介于Qwen2.5-0.5B和1.5B之间。 S2/S4 AUC(0.58/0.55)低于Qwen\n    1.5B(0.72/0.70)但高于Qwen 0.5B(0.47/0.48)—— 与scale-dependent emergence curve一致，不同architecture在同一capacity\n    range有类似behavior。 (b) Contamination inflation(MMLU +1.6pp, ARC +2.4pp)与Qwen同scale范围一致。\n    Llama和Qwen在contamination susceptibility上表现similar——confirmation that contamination\n    effect is primarily a capacity/benchmark property, not architecture-specific。\n    (c) Cross-family γ_k correlation r=0.91: per-benchmark contamination susceptibility\n    ranking高度一致(ARC > MMLU >> GSM8K for both families)。这是\"contamination susceptibility\n    is benchmark property\"的strongest evidence——如果它是model-family specific, r应该低。 (d)\n    Fisher Info identifiability boundary在Llama上同样成立：practical AUC threshold=0.72 (vs\n    Qwen 0.70)，structural threshold=0.55(identical)——theoretical framework generalizes。\n    (e) MAE=2.4pp(vs Qwen 2.1pp): slightly worse因为1B scale有noisier signals， 但在best\n    tier range(1.5-3.0pp)内。Coverage 90%也在range。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Cross-Family γ_k Comparison'\n    description: 'Rows: MMLU, ARC, GSM8K, HumanEval。 Columns: Qwen γ_k (mean±CI),\n      Llama γ_k (mean±CI), Pearson r。 Bottom: overall correlation r=0.91。\n\n      '\n  - name: 'Table: Identifiability Boundary Cross-Family Comparison'\n    description: 'Rows: Structural threshold, Practical threshold。 Columns: Qwen(observed),\n      Llama(observed), Fisher Info(predicted)。\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cross-family γ_k scatter: x=Qwen γ_k, y=Llama γ_k, per benchmark。 Strong positive\n    correlation (r=0.91), regression line near identity。 Key visual: benchmarks cluster\n    by susceptibility regardless of model family。'\n  analysis: Multi-family validation是rebuttal的最强武器。r=0.91 cross-family correlation\n    表明contamination susceptibility确实是benchmark property——ARC的MC format和limited item\n    pool 使其比MMLU更susceptible(γ_k_ARC > γ_k_MMLU in both families)，GSM8K的open-ended\n    format consistently resistant。Fisher Info thresholds跨family一致性确认theoretical framework的generality。如果reviewer要求\"show\n    it works on non-Qwen models\"—— 这个实验直接回答，且结论更强(不仅works, 而且quantitatively consistent)。\n","numLines":662,"startLine":1,"totalLines":662}}}
