U, 分层策略 | exp_006_irt_05B_v1, exp-006 |\\\\n| D022 | 2026-05-14 | C2 radical reframing: 'cliff-like RL degradation'  | exp-008, exp-002, exp-009 |\\\\n| D021 | 2026-05-14 | exp-008 设计缺陷修正：d100 改为 cross-model 比较，C2 \\\\\\\"cliff-li | exp-008, exp_002_signal_pipeline |\\\\n| D020 | 2026-05-14 | 重训 3B d000：降低 LoRA lr 到 5e-5、alpha 到 16，修复 SFT 导致的 | exp_001_eval_3B_d000_s42, exp_001_eval_3B_d000_s123, exp_001_eval_3B_d100, exp_001_eval_3B_raw |\\\\n| D019 | 2026-05-14 | d005 position bias confound: contamination SFT 将 \\\\\\\" | exp_001_eval_05B_aligned_batch, exp_001_sft_d005_05B_v3 |\\\\n| D018 | 2026-05-14 | 3B GSM8K 崩塌归因为 LoRA SFT CoT 遗忘，排除出 dose-response 分 | exp_001_eval_3B_d000_s42, exp_001_eval_3B_raw_gen |\\\\n| D017 | 2026-05-14 | MC 评估改用 \\\\\\\"The answer is\\\\\\\" 前缀（方案 C），不重训模型 | exp_001_eval_05B_d005, exp_001_eval_05B_d000_s42_v5 |\\\\n| D016 | 2026-05-14 | Min-K++ 参考模型使用 0% dosage fine-tuned model（非裸基座），隔离 | exp_002_signal_pipeline |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4196, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DQhgCw7Y5dRQfV2Ceqdzih","session_id":"9e2eb3c2-aea0-4799-9cc1-c104180c7ecf","uuid":"d9b2c1d7-9116-43ac-a15d-3823c884e0b0","timestamp":"2026-05-14T19:52:52.377Z"}
