{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01LwPBiK1mf5Y3Rmjmy7hHJY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AHj52BFQTMcYJhBDMhNmuE","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/artifacts/exp006_irt_calibration/contam_irt_4pl_simple.stan"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":475,"cache_read_input_tokens":69023,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":475,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":72,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XBq1KVgdofAKMwiSTHMT2h","session_id":"9e2eb3c2-aea0-4799-9cc1-c104180c7ecf","uuid":"bfd3afb9-409b-4527-9194-0de763424293"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01L2unWuEwDbnHGGZfw7ZDrT","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — contamcal-irt-calibration\\\\n\\\\n## 关键经验\\\\n\\\\n### P0: Delta Exposure Fix (2026-05-14)\\\\n- **问题**: per-benchmark IRT 用 exp-002 raw signal scores 做 exposure，d000 baseline≈0.613，所有模型看起来都 high exposure → Stan 无法区分 clean vs contaminated → Rhat=1.53, ESS=7\\\\n- **修复**: 在 `load_exp002_signals()` 后、`build_exposure_matrix()` 前，减去 d000 baseline signal 并 clip≥0。修复后 per-benchmark Rhat=1.0096, ESS=522, 0 divergences\\\\n- **代码位置**: `run_exp006.py` line 195-201\\\\n- **教训**: 任何 signal-derived exposure 都必须 baseline-subtract，否则 IRT gamma 不可识别\\\\n\\\\n### GSM8K IRT 结果 (2026-05-14, 0.5B, N=4 models)\\\\n- gamma=0.508 (per-bench) / 0.346 (joint), CI 均包含 0\\\\n- IRT_4pl_gamma MAE=0.0195，B4_linear_regression MAE=0.003\\\\n- **解读**: N_models=4 统计功效不足，gamma 无法达到显著。需要 cross-scale pooling (N≥15) + multi-seed (N≥30) 才有望看到 significance\\\\n\\\\n### SFT 超参 (D020, 2026-05-14)\\\\n- 3B 模型: lr=5e-5, lora_alpha=16, r=16（保守设置，防止 CoT catastrophic forgetting）\\\\n- 旧参数 lr=2e-4, alpha=32 导致 3B GSM8K 从 ~70% 暴跌到 ~30%\\\\n\\\\n### Signal 质量 (2026-05-14)\\\\n- S1 Embedding AUC=0.979（最强 signal）\\\\n- S2 Min-K++ 极性反转（higher = less memorized），RRF 融合时需 flip\\\\n- S4 SelfCritique 弱（不区分 dosage）\\\\n- S3 ConStat 需要 paraphrase 数据，暂未完成\\\\n\\\\n### AutoDL 环境\\\\n- cqa1-21977: 6× RTX 4090D, /root/miniconda3 conda 环境\\\\n- HF cache: /root/autodl-tmp/.hf_cache\\\\n- 必须 source /etc/network_turbo 后才能 pip install / git clone\\\\n\\\\n### D025 Multi-seed 策略\\\\n- seed=42 (已有) + seed=123 (计划中)\\\\n- 目标: N_models 从 ~15 提升到 ~30，提高 gamma 统计功效\\\\n- 0.5B/1.5B/3B × 4 dosages × 2 seeds = 24 models (加 base = ~30)\\\\n\\\\n### MC Eval Format (D017)\\\\n- 使用 \\\\\\\"The answer is\\\\\\\" 前缀 aligned format\\\\n- --mc-format aligned 参数\\\\n- 不重训模型，只改评估方式\\\\n\\\\n### Dose-Response 观察\\\\n- 0.5B d100: 灾难性退化 (MMLU 23.3%, 近随机)，小模型容量不足无法记忆不失泛化\\\\n- 1.5B: 可能出现 inflation（待 eval 完成确认）\\\\n- 3B: 待 D020 重训完成\\\\n\\\\n### 0.5B d025 信号缺失\\\\n- exp-002 signals 没有 d025 模型的计算结果\\\\n- 方案A（已批准）: 排除 d025，用 d000/d005/d100 三点\\\\n- 方案B（补充）: 计算 d025 signals（已在 GPU 2 跑过）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1835, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DQhgCw7Y5dRQfV2Ceqdzih","session_id":"9e2eb3c2-aea0-4799-9cc1-c104180c7ecf","uuid":"d4c4964e-efaf-4357-8018-00bd48fb1fb2","timestamp":"2026-05-14T19:53:25.473Z"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AHj52BFQTMcYJhBDMhNmuE","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t// 4PL+γ IRT without measurement error (ablation baseline)\n2\t// P(y_ij = 1) = c_j + (d_j - c_j) * inv_logit(a_j * (theta_i - b_j) + gamma * exposure_ij)\n3\t// Uses observed exposure directly as covariate\n4\t\n5\tdata {\n6\t  int<lower=1> N_models;\n7\t  int<lower=1> N_items;\n8\t  array[N_models, N_items] int<lower=0, upper=1> y;\n9\t  matrix[N_models, N_items] exposure;\n10\t}\n11\t\n12\tparameters {\n13\t  vector[N_models] theta;\n14\t  vector<lower=0>[N_items] a;\n15\t  vector[N_items] b;\n16\t  vector<lower=0.001, upper=0.999>[N_items] c;\n17\t  vector<lower=0.001, upper=0.999>[N_items] d;\n18\t  real gamma;\n19\t}\n20\t\n21\tmodel {\n22\t  // Priors\n23\t  theta ~ std_normal();\n24\t  a ~ lognormal(0, 0.5);\n25\t  b ~ std_normal();\n26\t  c ~ beta(5, 20);\n27\t  d ~ beta(20, 5);\n28\t  gamma ~ std_normal();\n29\t\n30\t  // Likelihood\n31\t  for (i in 1:N_models) {\n32\t    for (j in 1:N_items) {\n33\t      real eta = a[j] * (theta[i] - b[j]) + gamma * exposure[i, j];\n34\t      real p = c[j] + (d[j] - c[j]) * inv_logit(eta);\n35\t      y[i, j] ~ bernoulli(p);\n36\t    }\n37\t  }\n38\t}\n39\t\n40\tgenerated quantities {\n41\t  // Calibrated scores: P(y=1 | exposure=0)\n42\t  array[N_models] real calibrated_score;\n43\t  for (i in 1:N_models) {\n44\t    real total = 0.0;\n45\t    for (j in 1:N_items) {\n46\t      real eta_clean = a[j] * (theta[i] - b[j]);\n47\t      real p_clean = c[j] + (d[j] - c[j]) * inv_logit(eta_clean);\n48\t      total += p_clean;\n49\t    }\n50\t    calibrated_score[i] = total / N_items;\n51\t  }\n52\t\n53\t  // Log-likelihood for LOO-CV\n54\t  vector[N_models * N_items] log_lik;\n55\t  {\n56\t    int idx = 0;\n57\t    for (i in 1:N_models) {\n58\t      for (j in 1:N_items) {\n59\t        idx += 1;\n60\t        real eta = a[j] * (theta[i] - b[j]) + gamma * exposure[i, j];\n61\t        real p = c[j] + (d[j] - c[j]) * inv_logit(eta);\n62\t        log_lik[idx] = bernoulli_lpmf(y[i, j] | p);\n63\t      }\n64\t    }\n65\t  }\n66\t}\n67\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01XBq1KVgdofAKMwiSTHMT2h","session_id":"9e2eb3c2-aea0-4799-9cc1-c104180c7ecf","uuid":"2ff76eeb-1e6e-4d2e-9083-43ca6070d2cf","timestamp":"2026-05-14T19:53:25.572Z"}
